05", "personaname": "Siym", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SiymX/", "num_games_owned": 87, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 35690, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 62, "playtime_at_review": 1496, "last_played": 1787191666, "avatar": "5c35817b3baa312e96896ef21492b5dd3808329f"}, "language": "english", "review": "ENLIST NOW, TROOPER! \r\n\r\nFellow Citizens,\r\nAre you ready to serve? Do you have what it takes to protect our glorious galaxy? If so, Helldivers 2 is your call to arms! This game is not just a game; it's a mission, a duty, and a testament to your dedication to the cause of freedom and democracy. Remember, service guarantees citizenship!\r\n\r\nHelldivers 2 plunges you into the front lines of the galaxy's most perilous battles. From the insect-infested wastelands to the cybernetic horrors lurking in the shadows, every mission is a chance to prove your valor and secure our future. \r\n\r\nJoin your fellow Helldivers and take the battle to the enemy. Experience the thrill of coordinated strikes, the satisfaction of a job well done, and the honor of serving something greater than yourself. Remember, the bugs won't kill themselves, and the galaxy needs heroes like you!\r\n\r\nDo your part! Sign up today and show those bugs and cyborgs what humanity is made of. I'm doing my part! Are you? \r\n\r\nFor Democracy! For Freedom! \r\n\r\n(jokes aside)\r\nI really love the game. It's grindy but its still satisfying. It's fun to play with friends more but also fun when you are doing solo missions and bunch of random players join you as well. Just kick the weird ones out that keeps killing you. Other than that, highly recommended.", "timestamp_created": 1720481547, "timestamp_updated": 1720481547, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.485294133424758911", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primar